# src/coverage/ is a SOURCE module (N7 coverage-registry contracts), NOT test-coverage output.
# The monorepo-root .gitignore's un-anchored `coverage/` rule wrongly matches it, which left
# src/coverage/contracts.ts (imported by the frozen src/index.ts) untracked and broke fresh
# checkouts / CI. Re-include the directory here so it and future N7 files are tracked.
!/src/coverage/
